1 0 0 1 48 638 Tm (* Make the decision point explicit: Your appeal should answer whether a privilege ban followed your documents with exhibits, not adjectives.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 625 Tm (* Compare options deliberately: Know whether you are closer to Documented suspension, Informal ban, or Essential-service cut before you escalate.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 612 Tm (* Write one remedy sentence: Boards skim-state waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse in a single line tied to amenity cuts, due process, and written challenges.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 599 Tm (* Keep escalation proportionate: Match collections risk and dollar amount to mediation, counsel, or court only after the packet is complete.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 586 Tm () Tj
