1 0 0 1 48 469 Tm (Assemble dated photos, correspondence, ledgers, and comparables that speak directly to) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 456 Tm (whether a privilege ban followed your documents.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 443 Tm (4. Choose the procedural path) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 430 Tm (Pick cure, informal dispute, formal hearing, payment under protest, ADR, or counsel based on) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 417 Tm (deadlines and stakes around amenity cuts, due process, and written challenges.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 404 Tm (5. Submit a written ask) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 391 Tm (Send one clear remedy request \(waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse\) tied to whether a) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 378 Tm (privilege ban followed your documents, with exhibits attached.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 365 Tm (6. Confirm the outcome in writing) Tj
